<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Gwalia Consolidated half profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Gwalia Consolidated half profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  7.55 vs 4.06</p>
<p>    Net profit			  7.55 vs 4.06</p>
<p>    Sales				33.85 vs 2.68</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Gwalia Consolidated Ltd mines tantalum, tin, talc and silica sand. It is also the largest shareholder in major gold miner Sons of Gwalia Ltd with a 17.5 percent holding.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
